  storyText: "The Badlands\n\nNight City shrinks behind you. Desert, dead oil fields, rusted billboards. Out here the Aldecaldos nomads run the roads - and the Wraiths raid them.\n\nMirage: \"It's so quiet out here. I like it.\"\n\n1. Head for the Aldecaldos camp.\n2. Stop at the Sunset Motel.\n3. Take the canyon shortcut."
